🟩 5. Dynamic Inventory (critical for your setup)
You want dynamic inventory because:

Hyper‑V creates VMs dynamically

IPs may change

You want to manage multiple nodes

Tools
community.general.hv_inventory (Hyper‑V dynamic inventory plugin)

community.general.proxmox (if you ever expand)

kubernetes.core.k8s_inventory (for cluster introspection)

Pattern
Create inventory/hyperv.yml:

yaml
plugin: community.general.hv_inventory
host: <hyperv-host>
username: <user>
password: <pass>
validate_certs: false
Now Ansible discovers VMs automatically.

